      "explanation": "Lời giải.\na) ∆y = f (x0+∆x)−f (x0) = f (x0+1)−f (x0) = [(x0+1)3+(x0+1)2+1]−(x3\n0+x2\n0+1) = 3x2\n0+5x0+2.\nb) ∆y = f (−1 + ∆x) − f (−1) = (−1 + ∆x)2\n2 − 1\n2 = 1\n2[(−1 + ∆x)2 − 1] = 1\n2(∆x)2 − ∆x.\nc) Ta có: ∆y = f (x + ∆x) − f (x)\n= (x + ∆x)3 + 1 − (x3 + 1)\n= 3x2 · ∆x + 3x · ∆2x + ∆3x\n= ∆x(3x2 + 3x · ∆x + ∆2x).\n⇒ ∆y\n∆x = 3x2 + 3x · ∆x + ∆2x = 3x2 + 3x · ∆x + (∆x)2.\nd) Ta có: f (x) = 2x(x − 1) = 2x2 − 2x.\n∆y = f (x + ∆x) − f (x)\n= 2(x + ∆x)2 − 2 · (x + ∆x) − (2x2 − 2x)\n= 2x2 + 4x · ∆x + 2(∆x)2 − 2x − 2∆x − 2x2 + 2x\n= 4x · ∆x + 2(∆x)2 − 2∆x.\n⇒ ∆y\n∆x = 4x + 2 · ∆x − 2.\nĐáp án: a đúng ∣\n∣ b sai ∣\n∣ c sai ∣\n∣ d đúng \u0003\n226\n\nDỰ ÁN EX-ĐÚNG/SAI-2024\nFacebook “Nhóm Toán và LaTeX” 11-C7-B2.tex"
